.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIptr\fP The location of the pointer to be free'd 
.br
\fIfile\fP The filename of the function calling efree 
.br
\fIline\fP The line number efree was called 
.br
\fIfunc\fP The function calling efree
.RE
.PP

